            ],
            "page_id": 10
          }
        ],
        "content": "On June 19 tenders were invited for $500 million, or thereabouts, of 273-day Treasury bills, representing an additional amount of bills dated March 31, 1968, maturing March 31, 1969, and for $1 billion, or thereabouts, of 365-day Treasury bills to be dated June 30, 1968, to mature June 30, 196
